  "claim_boundaries": "This establishes necessity of the learned lexical-embedding path only for familiar LIBERO-Object tasks, prompts, objects, scenes, and the three fixed policies. It does not establish semantic grounding, paraphrase robustness, unseen-object or compositional generalization, cross-suite or physical transfer, or a benefit unique to tensor decomposability. The exact paired test is not cluster-robust inference.",
